      "file": "voiceover-01.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 29037,
      "text": "一个 AI 搞不定的事，一群 AI 能搞定吗？",
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.62
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "shot": 1,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-02.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 18285,
      "text": "这就是 Agent Teams。",
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "start": 3.62,
      "end": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-03.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30765,
      "text": "先说清楚，Agent Teams 不等于 Multi-Agent。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "start": 5.9,
      "end": 9.74
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-04.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 35565,
      "text": "Multi-Agent 是 90 年代的学术概念，泛指多个 AI 交互。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "start": 9.74,
      "end": 14.18
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-05.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 27885,
      "text": "而 Agent Teams 强调的是像人类团队一样，",
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "start": 14.18,
      "end": 17.66
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-06.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 14829,
      "text": "有明确的角色分工、",
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "start": 17.66,
      "end": 19.51
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 5,
      "file": "voiceover-07.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 21357,
      "text": "层级协调和共享目标。",
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "start": 19.51,
      "end": 22.18
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-08.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "这个概念是 CrewAI 在 2023 年带火的。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 22.18,
      "end": 26.04
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-09.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 43629,
      "text": "吴恩达 2024 年提出的 Agentic 设计模式进一步推动了它。",
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "start": 26.04,
      "end": 31.49
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-10.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 24621,
      "text": "现在 Claude Code 也内置了这个能力。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "start": 31.49,
      "end": 34.56
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-11.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 11757,
      "text": "你看这张图，",
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "start": 34.56,
      "end": 36.02
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-12.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25965,
      "text": "一个 Manager Agent 统筹协调，",
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start": 36.02,
      "end": 39.26
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-13.mp3",
