    {
      "index": 24,
      "shot": 6,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-24.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 37485,
      "text": "第二，别让多个 agent 同时改同一个文件，会冲突。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "start": 66.79,
      "end": 71.47
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "shot": 6,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-25.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 32301,
      "text": "第三，简单任务别开一堆 agent，浪费 token。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
